      "player": "GPT5n Rivals",
      "decision_index": 155,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Opponent is at 10 life with no flyers to block. Restless Anchorage could be animated as a 2/3 flyer for 2 extra damage plus a Map token, applying significant pressure. The mana was available to activate it.",
