    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "At 1 life facing lethal from Enduring Innocence, GPT5n activated Cori Mountain Monastery's ability before casting Day of Judgment. While they likely have enough remaining mana for Day of Judgment after the activation, this sequencing is risky at 1 life - they should prioritize the board wipe first to guarantee survival before spending mana on speculative card advantage.",
