    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "At 1 life facing lethal on board, GPT5n cast Consult the Star Charts before playing a land drop. Consult looks at top X cards where X = number of lands controlled. Playing Island or Sunbillow Verge first would let them see 7 cards instead of 6, improving card selection quality. Additionally, the land choices (two Sunbillow Verges) would enter untapped since they control a Plains (Hallowed Fountain), so there's no downside to playing land first.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Consult the Star Charts with 6 lands in play (seeing top 6 cards)",
      "better_line": "Play Sunbillow Verge (enters untapped, controls Plains via Hallowed Fountain) first, then cast Consult the Star Charts seeing 7 cards instead of 6, then still cast Day of Judgment with remaining mana",
      "type": "blunder",
