      "decision_index": 185,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "At 1 life with 3 lands already in hand (2x Sunbillow Verge + Island), picking another land over a second Jeskai Revelation is suboptimal. Jeskai Revelation provides crucial life gain (4 life), removal, card draw, and board presence - all critical when at 1 life.",
      "action_taken": "Selected Sunbillow Verge as one of the two cards to put into hand from Consult the Star Charts.",
      "better_line": "Select Jeskai Revelation (and possibly Restless Anchorage or Hallowed Fountain as the untapped land) to maximize survival chances at 1 life. A second Jeskai Revelation would provide another 4 life gain option.",
