      "description": "At 1 life, picking Restless Anchorage (a tapped land) over Jeskai Revelation (which gains 4 life, deals 4 damage, bounces a permanent, draws 2 cards) is suboptimal. They already have 8 lands and a Jeskai Revelation in hand, but at 1 life having a second copy provides crucial redundancy for survival. Lands are low priority when you're about to die.",
